# What Vercel uploads. NOT the same list as .gitignore — the CLI does not read
# that file, so anything excluded there is still uploaded unless it is named
# here. The deploy that prompted this died reading test-ledger/admin.rpc, a
# unix socket left by a Solana test validator; the same directory also holds
# faucet-keypair.json, which has no business inside a deployment bundle.

# Solana test-validator leftovers: a socket the uploader cannot read, ~40MB of
# ledger, and a keypair.
test-ledger/

# The Python memory sidecar. Deployed separately to its own host; Vercel only
# ever talks to it over HTTP from api/memory.ts.
sibyl-svc/

# Working notes, storyboards, QA scripts — gitignored, and not part of the app.
notes/

# Built locally; Vercel runs its own build.
dist/

.env
.env.*
